{"packId":"daily-2026-11-03","packVersion":2,"scoringVersion":1,"date":"2026-11-03","number":48,"puzzles":[{"id":"2026-11-03-pattern","skill":"pattern","kind":"grid","prompt":"Which shape completes the grid?","cells":[{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"square","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"square","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},null],"options":[{"shape":"diamond","tone":"gold"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"square","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"}],"answer":2,"explanation":["Every row and every column uses each shape exactly once.","Its row already has the teal circle and the navy triangle.","Its column already has the teal circle and the navy triangle.","That leaves the blue square."]},{"id":"2026-11-03-sudoku","skill":"sudoku","prompt":"Fill the grid with 1 to 6","size":6,"boxR":2,"boxC":3,"givens":[2,0,0,0,0,6,0,0,6,0,0,0,0,5,1,0,6,0,6,0,0,0,1,5,0,0,0,6,2,3,3,6,2,0,5,0],"solution":[2,1,4,5,3,6,5,3,6,2,4,1,4,5,1,3,6,2,6,2,3,4,1,5,1,4,5,6,2,3,3,6,2,1,5,4],"explanation":["Every row, every column and every 2×3 box uses each number from 1 to 6 exactly once.","The finished grid:","Row 1: 2 1 4 5 3 6","Row 2: 5 3 6 2 4 1","Row 3: 4 5 1 3 6 2","Row 4: 6 2 3 4 1 5","Row 5: 1 4 5 6 2 3","Row 6: 3 6 2 1 5 4"]},{"id":"2026-11-03-logic","skill":"logic","prompt":"Crack the 3-digit code","clues":[{"guess":[2,8,6],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[3,2,7],"rightPlace":2,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[5,9,0],"rightPlace":1,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[1,3,6],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":1}],"answer":[3,9,7],"explanation":["286: none of 2, 8, 6 appear in the code.","327: 3, 7 are in the right spot.","590: 9 is in the right spot.","136: 3 is in the code but placed differently."],"hint":"The last digit is odd."}]}